Manage the cluster listener. Example: remuda cluster listen --bind 127.0.0.1

Usage: remuda cluster listen [--bind IP[:PORT] [--allow-public] [--foreground] | --off]

Options:
  -h, --help              Print help
      --off               Stop the cluster listener
      --bind <IP[:PORT]>  Address; omitted port defaults to 7441
      --allow-public      Allow binding to a public interface
      --foreground        Run listener in the foreground

